        "action": "Add a bucket policy condition restricting access to restored objects. Use s3:ExistingObjectTag or scoped IAM policies to limit who can read restored Glacier objects during the restore window.",
        "example": "{\n  \"storage\": {\n    \"kind\": \"bucket\",\n    \"glacier\": {\n      \"restore_access_unrestricted\": false\n    }\n  }\n}\n"
